vendor/ffcs-union.json is the union of CodeChefVIT/ffcs `src/data` from:

  prod (b2bafad)
  PR #293  removed stale data, added SCOPE/AIML courses
  PR #296  SCOPE_F fresher data
  PR #297  SCE_F fresher data (+ SCE ('25 Batch))
  PR #298  SCORE_F BYB data

Every course and offering from every tree is kept; duplicates are removed by
faculty + venue + slot. Upstream PRs that delete stale rows therefore cannot
remove anything here.

Rebuild with:
  npx tsx scripts/build-union.ts <prod/src/data> <pr293/src/data> ... > none
(the script writes vendor/ffcs-union.json)

The repository is MIT. Course offerings are factual allocation data.
